%%% note
由来: mulet test/mulet/url_test.clj:47 (parseURI-test)
testing: Parse relative URI
元の形: url/parseURI の直接呼び出しを DW に書き換え
mulet: 成功
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import parseURI from dw::core::URL
output application/json
---
parseURI("/api/users?id=123")
%%% output application/json
{
  "isValid": true,
  "raw": "/api/users?id=123",
  "path": "/api/users",
  "query": "id=123",
  "isAbsolute": false,
  "isOpaque": false
}
